THE LEADERSHIP OF BOTH PARTIES

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:17.066
BELIEVES THIS.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:18.601
THE PROBLEM IS VOTERS DON'T

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:19.268
BELIEVE IT.

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:21.003
THEY STRONGLY DISAGREE AND HAVE

00:00:21.004 --> 00:00:21.938
FOR DECADES.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:23.539
THEY SAID SO IN POLLING

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.774
CONSISTENTLY BUT INSTEAD OF

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:26.075
PAYING ATTENTION TO WHAT THE

00:00:26.076 --> 00:00:27.143
