00:00:27.144 --> 00:00:28.811
PARTIES IGNORE IT AND INSTEAD

00:00:28.812 --> 00:00:30.846
WORK TOGETHER TO DO WHAT THEY

00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:31.814
WANT BY STEALTH.

00:00:31.815 --> 00:00:35.885
THEIR LATEST GAMBIT IS CALLED HR

00:00:35.886 --> 00:00:37.453
5038, A BILL CALLED THE FARM

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:39.755
WORK FORCE MODERNIZATION ACT OF

00:00:39.756 --> 00:00:40.122
2019.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:43.059
AS USUAL THE NAME IS ORWELLIAN.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.661
THE BILL DOES NOT MODERNIZE

00:00:45.662 --> 00:00:46.429
AMERICA'S WORK FORCE.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:47.330
JUST THE OPPOSITE.

00:00:47.331 --> 00:00:49.131
IT'S DESIGNED TO KEEP OUR

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:51.167
FARMING PRACTICES PRIMITIVE AND

00:00:51.168 --> 00:00:52.802
DEPENDENT UPON LOW WAGE MANUAL

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:53.102
LABOR.

