00:01:03.046 --> 00:01:03.980
ALL OF THEM.

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:06.515
EVEN ILLEGAL ALIENS CONVICTED OF

00:01:06.516 --> 00:01:08.751
CRIME WOULD BE ELIGIBLE FOR

00:01:08.752 --> 00:01:10.619
PERMANENT RESIDENCY AND

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.020
CITIZENSHIP.

00:01:11.021 --> 00:01:12.154
BENEFICIARIES WOULD NOT HAVE TO

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:15.157
