00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:20.196
DON'T YOU TRY SOMETHING LIKE

00:01:20.197 --> 00:01:21.530
THAT AS A U.S. CITIZEN.

00:01:21.531 --> 00:01:23.199
CONGRESS WILL HAVE NO MERCY BUT

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.001
FOR FOREIGN NATIONALS, NO

00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:25.434
PROBLEM.

00:01:25.435 --> 00:01:26.635
