00:01:54.898 --> 00:01:56.265
THERE IS NO PENALTY FOR FRAUD.

00:01:56.266 --> 00:01:57.933
IN OTHER WORDS, THERE WOULD BE

00:01:57.934 --> 00:02:00.302
NO REASON NOT TO SUBMIT A BOGUS

00:02:00.303 --> 00:02:00.703
APPLICATION.

00:02:00.704 --> 00:02:02.238
NEEDLESS TO SAY MANY PEOPLE

00:02:02.239 --> 00:02:02.538
WOULD.

00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:04.040
JUST AS THEY DID 30 YEARS AGO

00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:06.475
DURING THE RONALD REAGAN

00:02:06.476 --> 00:02:06.876
AMNESTY.

00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:09.345
THAT SUPPOSEDLY LIMITED FARM

00:02:09.346 --> 00:02:11.113
WORKER AMNESTY DLUNS OF

00:02:11.114 --> 00:02:12.214
THOUSANDS OF FRAUDULENT

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:12.648
APPLICATIONS.

