WERE ABLE TO BENEFIT FROM THE

00:02:24.194 --> 00:02:24.527
AMNESTY.

00:02:24.528 --> 00:02:25.895
THINK ABOUT THAT FOR A MINUTE.

00:02:25.896 --> 00:02:26.962
IT WAS A JOKE.

00:02:26.963 --> 00:02:28.597
NOW THEY WANT TO DO IT AGAIN BUT

00:02:28.598 --> 00:02:31.033
ON A MUCH LARGER SCALE SO TO SUM

00:02:31.034 --> 00:02:32.935
UP, THE FARM WORK FORCE

00:02:32.936 --> 00:02:35.037
MODERNIZATION ACT OF 2019 WOULD

00:02:35.038 --> 00:02:36.872
REWARD LAW BREAKING, EXACERBATE

00:02:36.873 --> 00:02:40.042
THE BORDER CRISIS AND UNDERMINE

00:02:40.043 --> 00:02:42.244
THE ALREADY STALLED WAGES OF

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:43.946
AMERICAN BLUE COLLAR WORKERS.

00:02:43.947 --> 00:02:45.781
IT'S PRETTY MUCH THE MIRROR

00:02:45.782 --> 00:02:47.049
IMAGE, THE EXACT OPPOSITE OF

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:48.350
WHAT DONALD TRUMP RAN ON JUST

00:02:48.351 --> 00:02:51.087
THREE YEARS AGO AND YET MEMBERS

